Native engine app (experiments/native-engine/frontend): melee-unlocked's Practice menu (practice_menu.cpp) built into the
app with MU_PROAI_FRONTEND. Nothing of Phillip's AI ships with the app: when it is not downloaded, the menu's
"Fight a pro" row leads to its page, where "Download Phillip's AI (about N MB)" asks first (a page like upstream's
"Stronger Pro AI" question: Download / Not now), and the pros' habit tables still play meanwhile. The Search row says
that this app searches from Online Play (its own search starts there). After patches/0112.
Applied to a build-time copy only (build/native-engine-gfx/gen/proai).
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

